fixture zone1_03_optional_reward
doc Room 03's optional path, the reward (BUILD.md s3: a Lantern-tier Votive, an entity marker at x 4160 u as room 04's alcove has): past the shaft that is the way back, the hall goes on 4 tiles to the reward ledge. A plain hop clears the 96 u shaft from the hall's last tile, at the run speed, with the coyote window to spare; the stick is held right throughout.
room zone1/03_pogo_chain
spawn 3700 320
frames 80
input
  0..33 R
  34..36 R jump
  37..79 R
end
expect
  never 0..79 event.hazard=1
  mark ledge 34..79 event.land=1
  at ledge x>4096u y=320u
end
